flowchart TD
  Token[Validated Cognito access token] --> Subject[Cognito sub]
  Subject --> User[PostgreSQL user]
  User --> Platform[Platform role]
  User --> Membership[Tenant membership]
  Platform --> Policy[Endpoint policy]
  Membership --> Scope[Tenant scope]
  Policy --> Query[Scoped query]
  Scope --> Query
  Query --> Audit[Audit privileged mutation]
